pgenlib (PLINK 2.0 genotype file library), vendored from https://github.com/chrchang/plink-ng
(master branch, downloaded 2026-11-19; PLINK2_BASE_VERNUM 906). Files: 2.0/include/pgenlib_read,
pgenlib_misc, plink2_base, plink2_bits, plink2_simd (.h/.cc), unmodified.
